# data - keep manifests/small silver in git, exclude large raw per-run
# Uncomment to track everything (current docs say data/ tracked):
# data/bronze/*/raw/
# data/bronze/*/headers/
# To enable Release-only large files (recommended for GitHub):
data/bronze/*/raw/
data/bronze/*/headers/
# keep latest symlink + manifest/stats if you want audit trail without 44M per commit:
# !data/bronze/latest
# !data/bronze/*/manifest.jsonl
# !data/bronze/*/scrapy_stats.json

